cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the scientific report relevant to the result you use."
type: software
title: "CAOS Mineral Plant Explorer: Global and area-level process visualization"
version: 0.02.003
authors:
  - family-names: Santibáñez-Leal
    given-names: Felipe
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0150-3246
    affiliation: "CAOS open-research programme, Santiago, Chile"
repository-code: https://github.com/fsantibanezleal/CAOS_Mineral_Plant_Explorer
url: https://github.com/fsantibanezleal/CAOS_Mineral_Plant_Explorer
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A global and area-level mine-to-plant explorer with distinct 2D site plans,
  process schematics and 3D spatial views, observation histories, versioned
  upstream engine evidence, and a configurable
  read-only OPC UA gateway, and reproducible synthetic model comparisons.
  Two causal prediction families are actually fitted and calibrated. The
  reference does not establish performance at an operating plant.
keywords:
  - mineral processing
  - area process diagrams
  - 3D plant visualization
  - OPC UA
  - data reconciliation
  - causal forecasting
  - reproducible research
